   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>The Comms working group creates the narratives we present to the world, sets up our communication platforms and promotes public good focused TE projects.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Meetings: Tuesdays at 6pm CET</li>\n<li>Where? <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2DSFBaT\">Comms voice channel on Discord</a>\n</li>\n<li>WG Lead: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/chuygarcia92\">@chuygarcia92</a>\n</li>\n<li>Discussions happen on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7vM2e9NHkf\">TEC-Comms</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17w_UVi7lJjUNtj1Ji1WGd7Osk-E0edmfIRNoGRSP3yI/edit#heading=h.4qr126s3qfr1\">Comms WG Manifesto<br/>\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UTNNyYLf6WC1wlytoU9IJ46z2I32NX0MrtJOs3j9Ahw/edit\">Notes and Agenda </a> - The weekly calls will always be following this agenda</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://miro.com/app/board/o9J_kjDw5AE=/\">Story Canvas</a> - A collective narrative board.<br/>\npassword: TokenEngineering</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/TECommons/coordination/labels/Communications%20TEC\">Github issues </a>- Open for collaboration <img alt=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-comms-platforms-1\" name=\"tec-comms-platforms-1\"></a>TEC Comms Platforms</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AcMP3x5\">Discord</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@tecommons\">Medium</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TECommons\">Github </a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/tecommons/\">LinkedIn</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/tecmns\">Twitter</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCagCOhMqMNU29rWx259-tcg\">YouTube</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/\">Forum / Discourse</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
