   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 5,
   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#comms-wg-new-manifesto-1\" name=\"comms-wg-new-manifesto-1\"></a>Comms WG - New Manifesto</h1>\n<p>Dear TEC Community, I’m happy to present you our updated manifesto as well as our last roadmap.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12imDK1ofGvSzTSI-p1b1Keu2HTMBzPt-uxTzSQAXPkE/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">COMMS WG MANIFESTO</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://miro.com/app/board/o9J_lbkGJHQ=/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">COMMS ROADMAP</a></p>\n<p>I want to take the opportunity to thank everyone that has supported the Comms WG the past few months, I hope we can serve your needs better for these upcoming exciting times for the TEC.</p>",
